
  - [1mUsername is the identifier[0m — [38;5;153mlogin[39m already logs [38;5;153musername[39m; drop the new parameter and improve the tracking around it
    instead. Costs nothing, rules out nothing, but gives you no stable ID if usernames can change.
  - [1mCaller-supplied [38;5;153muserId[39m third parameter[0m — matches your literal request, but the only caller has nothing to pass, so
